      InFrame t.seam (A.fb (t.m2 + 1) (Nat.le_of_succ_le hi) β) (t.cst μ).D P κ.1 g →
      TopLev t.Ch t.sel (t.tup μ) (t.cst μ) (t.m2 + 1 + 1) P g' z' →
      InFrame t.seam (A.fb (t.m2 + 1 + 1) hi β') (topDep t.sel (t.tup μ) (t.cst μ)) P κ'.1 g' →
